OL,3,AIsraeli strike on Gaza hospital kills
OL,4,Asix Palestinians, health ministry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least six people have been killed
OL,7,Fand a large number injured in an
OL,8,FIsraeli air strike on Nasser hospital,
OL,9,Fthe biggest hospital in the southern
OL,10,FGaza Strip, the Hamas-run health
OL,11,Fministry says.
OL,13,FEyewitnesses told the BBC that a single
OL,14,Fmissile fired by a warplane hit a
OL,15,Fbuilding containing the surgical wards
OL,16,Fand intensive care units overnight.
OL,18,FThe health ministry said medical staff,
OL,19,Fpatients and companions were killed. It
OL,20,Fcondemned the attack as a "flagrant
OL,21,Fviolation of international laws and
OL,22,Fconventions".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
