OL,3,AIsraeli strike on Gaza hospital kills
OL,4,Asix Palestinians, health ministry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Israeli military said it struck a
OL,7,Fsenior Hamas figure and other
OL,8,Foperatives from the group's armed wing
OL,9,Fwho had been operating within the
OL,10,Fhospital.
